OL,3,GNEWSAHospital payout after Covid-19
OL,4,Apatient suffered stroke
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital trust has agreed a
OL,7,Fsix-figure settlement with a woman who
OL,8,Fsuffered a stroke after a catheter was
OL,9,Fmistakenly inserted into an artery
OL,10,Finstead of a vein while she was being
OL,11,Ftreated for Covid-19.
OL,13,FThe woman, who was 32 at the time, had
OL,14,Fbeen admitted to Whiston Hospital on
OL,15,FMerseyside suffering from breathing
OL,16,Fproblems.
OL,18,FThe woman said the incident had
OL,19,Fsignificantly affected her independence
OL,20,Fand quality of life and had left her
OL,21,Fwith impaired vision and weakness.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
