OL,4,Apatient suffered stroke
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Mersey and West Lancashire Teaching
OL,7,FHospitals NHS Trust representative said
OL,8,Fthe trust was "sincerely sorry" over
OL,9,Fthe mistake, which happened in February
OL,10,F2021.
